# Code owners for this repository.
#
# Purpose: this file exists so GitHub automatically requests my review on
# every pull request that touches an owned path — including pull requests
# opened from forks, since a fork PR is evaluated against the CODEOWNERS
# file on the base branch in this repository, not the one in the fork.
# That puts every incoming PR into my "Review requested" queue instead of
# relying on me noticing a notification.
#
# Deliberately NOT paired with branch protection's "Require review from
# Code Owners". GitHub does not let a code owner satisfy that requirement
# on a pull request they authored themselves, so with a single owner it
# would block every PR I open — including Dependabot's. Revisit if a
# second maintainer with write access is ever added.
#
# Owners must have write access to the repository. Outside contributors
# opening fork PRs are not owners and are unaffected by this file.

# Everything.
